WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.800
If you take a blood thinner medication, you may need to adjust your timing

2
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.100
before the procedure.

3
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:09.270
Blood thinners can affect our ability to safely address anything we find during

4
00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:10.300
your colonoscopy,

5
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.500
so getting the timing right matters.

6
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:16.200
Please contact your doctor's office as soon as possible if you haven't already

7
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:17.400
discussed this with them.

8
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:21.000
Do not stop or change your blood thinner on your own.

9
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.210
They will give you specific instructions based on your medication and your

10
00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:27.000
personal health history.

11
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.900
This is an important one, so please don't wait on it.
